11
00:00:16,728 --> 00:00:17,960
Summed once per order:

12
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:18,891
700.

13
00:00:18,911 --> 00:00:20,490
Krusgraph flags this against your rows,

14
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:23,241
